{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08298","headline":"赠武十七谔幷序 · 李白","name":"赠武十七谔幷序","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"马如一匹练，明日过吴门。\n乃是要离客，西来欲报恩。\n笑开燕匕首，拂拭竟无言。\n狄犬吠清洛，天津成塞垣。\n爱子隔东鲁，空悲断肠猨。\n林回弃白璧，千里阻同奔。\n君爲我致之，轻齎涉淮原。\n精诚合天道，不媿远游魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}